At raw talent level 1 you can use '''{{t|Steamgun turret|Steamgun turrets}}''', which fire at a random target nearby for {{ctwd|100|150%}} steamgun damage. These shots bypass allies.

At raw talent level 3 you can use '''{{t|Flame turret|Flame turrets}}''', which deal {{fire}} damage to enemies in a radius 3 cone. Flame turrets gain 5 + {{ctstmd|5|50}} bonus armor and 30% resistance to all damage.

At raw talent level 4 you can use '''{{t|Medic turret|Medic turrets}}''', which emit a healing mist that restores {{ctstmd|5|60}} life to allies and reduces the duration of newly applied detrimental effects by {{cts|10|45%}}.


